Message-ID: <Yzb98VoW12A.HQNA2GC-i1AJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/distance-sampling/c/Yzb98VoW12A/m/HQNA2GC-i1AJ>
